      "updated": 1792261406433,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Rule in the sync script, every page: drop the first body heading when it equals the frontmatter title (MRT repeats\nits <Head> title as the first H2 on all 95 pages). docs-diff applies the same rule, so no allowlist. Page checks that\ncount headings adjust by one. The description line stays: it is the short summary, the body paragraph is the long one.",
      "originalText": "Rule in the sync script, every page: drop the first body heading when it equals the frontmatter title (MRT repeats\nits <Head> title as the first H2 on all 95 pages). docs-diff applies the same rule, so no allowlist. Page checks that\ncount headings adjust by one. The description line stays: it is the short summary, the body paragraph is the long one.",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "containerId": null,
